        ]
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel, then transfer to visit Amboro Park, a cloud forest where you can enjoy the beauty of large ferns, undoubtedly an unforgettable experience. We will take a walk in the area, and in the afternoon, return to Santa Cruz. We'll make a stop to enjoy the crystal-clear waters of the Cuevas waterfalls surrounded by vegetation. Night at Hotel LP Equipetrol."
    },
